Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.98,0:00:07.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Story.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.78,0:01:58.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,found us in DigiVault into Angemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.84,0:02:03.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bat for Brains took off, but I'm sure\Nhe'll return soon, and he won't be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.24,0:02:04.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, he's never happy.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.31,0:02:14.98,Sign,,0,0,300,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\3c&H000000&}{\fad(300,0)}{\fs30\b1}The Bonds of Fate! Tailmon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.82,0:02:11.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unmei no Kizuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.46,0:02:13.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tailmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.90,0:02:16.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.26,0:02:18.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.34,0:02:19.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai, you're late.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.72,0:02:20.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.38,0:02:22.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.29,0:02:23.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kamiya residence?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.64,0:02:24.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.80,0:02:27.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So did you find the 8th\NDigidestined Kid yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.40,0:02:29.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I didn't have any luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.64,0:02:34.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There weren't any other students who\Nmoved from Heightened Butte Terrace.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.70,0:02:36.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that can't be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.08,0:02:37.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There must be someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.74,0:02:40.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, whoever it is, they\Nweren't in my address book.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.80,0:02:43.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check your own book before\Nyou start yelling at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.32,0:02:44.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.23,0:02:46.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did I do with my book anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.28,0:02:47.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You still haven't found it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.88,0:02:48.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.79,0:02:50.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's only the future of\Nthe world depending on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.46,0:02:51.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.50,0:02:55.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.64,0:02:57.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to find my address book.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.40,0:03:00.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miko, Ty's room is messier\Nthan your litter box.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.72,0:03:07.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Kari really is the eighth-digit\Ndestined child, then I have to destroy her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.54,0:03:10.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But every time I see her, I\Nget this strange sensation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.96,0:03:15.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still don't understand why I wasn't\Nable to attack her when I have a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.18,0:03:24.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.48,0:03:27.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.90,0:03:32.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you going already?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.52,0:03:35.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.72,0:03:37.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could have stopped the\NDigidestined once and for all,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.02,0:03:40.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but something was pulling me away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.14,0:03:42.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that little pet cat over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.12,0:03:43.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's got it so easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.62,0:03:45.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She gets fed gourmet food out of a can.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.90,0:03:48.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then she gets to chase a sock all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.08,0:03:49.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talk about a perfect life.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.78,0:03:52.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody was nice to me like\Nthat when I was growing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.38,0:03:53.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody was nice, period.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.16,0:04:01.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back when I was Salamon, I was\Na slave to the evil Myotismon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.12,0:04:08.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every time you look at me with\Nthose eyes, I'll make you suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.24,0:04:16.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't understand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.18,0:04:19.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess he just didn't like my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.36,0:04:23.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is one of the scars that Myotismon\Ngave me just because I have these eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.04,0:04:25.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.14,0:04:28.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish I could remember where I was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.44,0:04:31.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no idea what I did\Nbefore I met my Otis, Mon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.34,0:04:32.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My past is a blur.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.18,0:04:35.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thinking about the good old days?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.42,0:04:37.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to tell\Nyou again, Wizard Mon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.56,0:04:39.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't read my thoughts\Nwithout my permission!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.86,0:04:41.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Gatomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.52,0:04:42.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.22,0:04:46.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And shouldn't you be out looking\Nfor the Eighth Digidestined Human?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.36,0:04:47.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'll get right on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.02,0:04:58.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still, no reaction from the crest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.54,0:05:05.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's reacting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.56,0:05:08.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what's causing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.02,0:05:16.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Digivice Thunderballmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.70,0:05:21.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Wizardmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.48,0:05:23.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What you doing over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.08,0:05:26.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,uh nothing it's hard to believe\Nyou came all the way out here
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.52,0:05:29.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to do nothing come on tell me\Nwhat you found all right but if
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.78,0:05:34.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i show you you have to promise\Nnot to tell anyone come on show
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.14,0:05:38.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me all right it's a bottle of\Ngreen chili sauce it's great on
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.34,0:05:41.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,tacos what are you doing eating\Non the job when there's work
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.58,0:05:44.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to be done you should be looking\Nfor the eight digit destined
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.80,0:05:48.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,child like the others please don't\Ntell lord my Myotismon why don't
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.70,0:05:51.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you get rid of this for me all\Nright boy You know what I hope?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.78,0:05:54.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope that the all-night\Ndrive-thru is still open.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.68,0:05:58.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way I'm handing\Nthis over to DemiDevimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.52,0:06:00.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll take all the credit for himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.70,0:06:05.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But wait, if the Digivice is here,\Nwhere is the Ith child hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.06,0:06:08.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Both horses were reported\Nto be in stable condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.92,0:06:10.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now back to our top story.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.76,0:06:13.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Several more strange\Nmonsters have been sighted
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.26,0:06:15.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,earlier today in and\Naround the Tokyo area.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.44,0:06:17.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the same community,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.08,0:06:19.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there have been more\Nreports of young girls being
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.26,0:06:22.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,struck down by what\Ndoctors call sudden anemia.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.50,0:06:24.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Investigators say these\Nincidents may be related.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.82,0:06:26.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now on to the weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.50,0:06:27.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sudden anemia?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.78,0:06:30.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.38,0:06:32.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.29,0:06:33.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hi, Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.21,0:06:34.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you just see the news?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.28,0:06:36.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't have to see\Nit because I was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.20,0:06:37.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just got back from the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.50,0:06:40.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did, so that report on\Ntelevision about the monsters was...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.86,0:06:41.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.77,0:06:43.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was Myotismon, and\Nwas he on the warpath?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.02,0:06:47.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He even got rid of two\Nof his own flump What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.38,0:06:50.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai, we don't know how much time\Nwe've got left I'm telling you,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.70,0:06:54.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we've got to hurry up and find the eighth\Nchild My Otis Mon don't mangle him I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.94,0:06:56.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if he finds him before we do
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.34,0:06:58.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wizard Mon, what is it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.00,0:07:03.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go away before I use you as my scratching\Npost Sorry to disturb you again,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.22,0:07:04.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gatomon, but... But what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.50,0:07:08.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Digivice, where'd you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.36,0:07:11.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I found it in a crow's nest\Nin the Iraqi woods Then
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.60,0:07:14.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Eighth Digidestined must\Nbe somewhere near there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.44,0:07:16.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, the Eighth Child is...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.56,0:07:17.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.90,0:07:20.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you see, Tailmon... What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.42,0:07:25.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if the location of the Child\Nis in somewhere inside your own heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.08,0:07:27.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.34,0:07:32.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe that long ago you buried\Naway an important part of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.90,0:07:36.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And somewhere deep inside\Nyour heart lies the key
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.00,0:07:39.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to the identity of the\NEighth Digidestined Child.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.78,0:07:41.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try to remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.58,0:07:45.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what's holding you back could\Nit be you're afraid of what
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.00,0:07:50.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You might find you can get your\Nlost memories back. You can.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.44,0:07:54.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,remember your past without\Nfear end your long nightmare
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.16,0:07:57.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and try to remember just leave\Nme alone who sent you here,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.56,0:07:58.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Myotismon?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.50,0:08:02.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my Otis Mon has nothing to do\Nwith this I fight by your side,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.66,0:08:06.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not his I tell you these things\Nnow because you are my friend
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.36,0:08:11.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,before I met you, I was always\Nalone I was constantly traveling,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.84,0:08:13.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,never stopping to make any friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.62,0:08:16.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then one day, I fell\Nfrom the sky and crashed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.80,0:08:18.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But no one stopped to help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.60,0:08:21.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I was a goner until you came.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.12,0:08:24.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, drink this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.48,0:08:28.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like he passed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.94,0:08:33.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, you're awake. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.06,0:08:35.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you save me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.28,0:08:36.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't do that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.38,0:08:37.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just couldn't leave you lying there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.06,0:08:39.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.40,0:08:40.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I'll be going now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.78,0:08:42.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.92,0:08:44.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not strong enough to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.50,0:08:47.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you helped me, but I\Ndon't have anything for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.22,0:08:50.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want anything, but you\Nmust be very lonely to say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.94,0:08:51.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.22,0:08:56.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you've been alone for a long\Ntime, your heart becomes very hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.34,0:08:58.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It happens to everyone, you know, even me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.34,0:09:02.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't remember any of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.36,0:09:03.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's how it happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.88,0:09:07.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you saved me because\Nyou wanted something in return.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.36,0:09:09.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't understand\Nthe concept of compassion
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.66,0:09:11.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because loneliness had hardened my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.88,0:09:15.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you taught me that all\Ncreatures have good inside of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.92,0:09:17.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's when you told me your secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.88,0:09:24.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My whole life, I just keep waiting and\Nsearching, but I never find her. Find who?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.28,0:09:26.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you waiting and searching for?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.18,0:09:27.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.22,0:09:28.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was too long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.02,0:09:31.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I know is I'm waiting for someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.58,0:09:34.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Waiting? Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.50,0:09:35.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what you told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.12,0:09:38.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why can't I remember\Nwho I was waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.78,0:09:40.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who could it possibly be?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.68,0:09:41.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miko!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.44,0:09:44.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.10,0:09:45.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't come out here at this hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.04,0:09:48.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go back inside. Good kitty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.24,0:09:50.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.15,0:09:53.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think perhaps your search\Nis finally over. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.34,0:09:56.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you? Wizard Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.26,0:09:57.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are you able to fly like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.98,0:09:59.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.52,0:10:02.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's you. Hello again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.26,0:10:03.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're Agumon's friend, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.60,0:10:06.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How come you ran away last time I saw you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.10,0:10:10.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that? What...?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.40,0:10:16.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wizardmon, tell me, is this girl\Nthe eighth Digidestined? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.74,0:10:18.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, then who is her Digimon?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.90,0:10:20.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.54,0:10:22.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were waiting for someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.44,0:10:23.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try to remember. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.04,0:10:26.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My memory is starting to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.16,0:10:29.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I was definitely waiting for someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.44,0:10:32.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ever since I was\NNyaromon, I was so lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.62,0:10:37.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every day I just kept waiting\Nand waiting. The seasons
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.18,0:10:40.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,changed and the years rolled\Nby And still I kept waiting,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.54,0:10:41.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but no one ever came
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.60,0:10:44.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then when I became Solomon,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.64,0:10:48.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I started searching I went\Non a journey But what I
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.46,0:10:51.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,finally found was not the\Nsomeone I had been waiting for
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.84,0:10:58.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instead I found evil and darkness
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.62,0:11:00.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Myotismon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.64,0:11:05.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then those days of torture\Nand despair began, and
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.68,0:11:08.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i started to forget forget\Nthat i was waiting for
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.82,0:11:12.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,someone searching for\Nsomeone well what are you
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.28,0:11:15.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,guys talking about what\Ndoes any of this have to
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.26,0:11:18.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do with me someone's out\Nthere talking to curry
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.70,0:11:24.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,huh curry get away what's\Nthe matter Tai what do you
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.22,0:11:27.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,digimon want wait listen\Nto what i have to say
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.52,0:11:31.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,curry you get over here\Nthose two are evil Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.36,0:11:32.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, they're not evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.00,0:11:34.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gatomon has been searching for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.64,0:11:36.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For me and the eighth Digidestined
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.32,0:11:38.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,child.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.23,0:11:39.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.16,0:11:41.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari, are you okay? Oh, no! Gatomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.68,0:12:05.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You all right? I'm fine.\NThis is nothing compared
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.04,0:12:08.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to what i've been through did you see that
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.76,0:12:12.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gatomon saved kari now\Nthat you remember do you
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.24,0:12:16.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,understand yes i was waiting\Nfor the digi destined
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.68,0:12:19.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,human i belonged with\Nthat's you kari you're
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.80,0:12:22.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the eighth digi destined\Nyou were waiting just
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.46,0:12:25.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for me i've been searching\Nforever and ever for
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.42,0:12:28.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you i could have just called\Nguess Guess what, Tai?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.16,0:12:30.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gatomon's my Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.50,0:12:31.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I've got one, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.76,0:12:32.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be silly, Kari.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.90,0:12:33.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.84,0:12:37.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It makes perfect sense, considering\Nshe's the eighth Digidestined.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.44,0:12:39.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right, and I'm her Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.28,0:12:41.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what happens,\NI'll always protect her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.96,0:12:44.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, then why are you a\Npart of Myotismon's army?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.20,0:12:45.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And just who is this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.68,0:12:46.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's called Wizardmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.10,0:12:50.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He put himself in great danger\Nto bring me this Digivice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.36,0:12:51.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.56,0:12:53.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how do I know if I\Ncan trust him or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.30,0:12:54.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Frankly,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.21,0:12:55.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care whether you trust me or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.70,0:12:58.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'm going to follow Gatomon\Nas long as she needs me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.80,0:13:00.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, you take the device.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.14,0:13:03.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why give it to Tai?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.48,0:13:04.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It belongs to Kari.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.66,0:13:05.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She can't be seen with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.96,0:13:10.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Myotismon finds out she's the eighth\Nchild and Gatomon is her Digimon,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.46,0:13:13.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then he'll destroy Gatomon and he\Nwon't rest until he finds Kari.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.84,0:13:16.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you have the Digivice, then\Ntheir secret will be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.74,0:13:19.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll take it, but you\Nbetter not be double-crossing us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.92,0:13:20.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.83,0:13:23.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your sister needs her crest, the real one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.30,0:13:24.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The real one?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.84,0:13:28.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This Crest is just a copy that\Nwas created to find the Digivice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.74,0:13:32.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Myotismon is the only one\Nwith access to the real Crest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.10,0:13:33.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to get it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.96,0:13:35.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave everything to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.98,0:13:38.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, where's Myotismon's hideout?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.42,0:13:40.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll come with you and we can help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.36,0:13:41.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.36,0:13:43.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be careful, Gatomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.14,0:13:47.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can we trust them? We have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.70,0:13:48.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.46,0:13:57.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Myotismon has to be keeping Kari's\Ncrest somewhere in the hideout.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.86,0:14:00.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we have to search his room.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.28,0:14:04.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.20,0:14:06.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Myotismon is feeding upon the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.52,0:14:11.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said no one may enter\Nuntil he returns at dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.32,0:14:12.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, forget about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.12,0:14:15.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a matter of fact, Thunderbolt...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.48,0:14:20.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't remember a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.62,0:14:21.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What were we talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.68,0:14:23.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be leaving you of guard duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.52,0:14:25.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go home and get some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.14,0:14:27.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, that's right. See ya. Hold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.92,0:14:29.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't forget to leave us the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.42,0:14:32.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, the key. Here. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.54,0:14:33.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a nice guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.38,0:14:35.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.62,0:14:47.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, Wizardmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.12,0:14:50.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's find the crest and\Ncruise on out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.26,0:14:51.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place gives me the creeps.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.96,0:14:52.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.87,0:14:55.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got plenty of time\Nbefore the sun comes up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.12,0:14:57.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My oldest man won't be back for hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.90,0:15:00.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe he keeps it in the coffin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.38,0:15:04.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it. Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.98,0:15:06.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now let's just get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.62,0:15:07.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.54,0:15:09.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.68,0:15:11.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.28,0:15:12.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.24,0:15:15.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're looking for something,\Nmaybe I can assist you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.12,0:15:15.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another copy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.03,0:15:20.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think I'd just leave the original\Nlying around for thieves like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.98,0:15:25.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wizarmon! I'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.30,0:15:27.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.52,0:15:29.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From the first time you\Nlooked at me with those eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.88,0:15:33.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew you'd turn against me, and that's\Nwhy I had to teach you by punishing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.70,0:15:36.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would have hurt you even more\Nwhen you became a good servant,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.44,0:15:39.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I promise you I will not\Nbe so easy on you this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.26,0:15:43.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And do you think your betrayal\Nwill go unpunished, Wizard Man?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.62,0:15:48.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could I betray you when I was\Nnever on your side to begin with?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.44,0:15:49.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You little fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.92,0:15:53.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grizzly wing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.28,0:16:13.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We really have to stay together.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.84,0:16:17.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those who play together lose together.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.74,0:16:18.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.92,0:16:21.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You soon will be, you\Npathetic little traitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.66,0:16:24.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Magical game!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.78,0:16:36.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look there, up in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.66,0:16:38.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wizardmon and Gatomon are in a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.74,0:16:39.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.65,0:16:41.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope they're not being hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.08,0:16:43.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.32,0:16:45.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.40,0:16:46.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to go too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.80,0:16:48.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't risk you getting hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.50,0:16:49.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.26,0:17:03.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I hope you realize there's no safe\Nplace to hide during this lightning storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.96,0:17:08.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Magical game!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.30,0:17:26.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are those eyes again, and this time,\Nnot only are they filled with rebellion,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.82,0:17:28.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I can also see a glimmer of hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.94,0:17:31.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hope that one day your\Ndreams will come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.38,0:17:32.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.29,0:17:35.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe in my dreams, and\Nthat's how I've made it this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.24,0:17:37.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And just what have you really achieved?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.08,0:17:38.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You believe in your worthless friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.92,0:17:41.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you believe that your\Ndreams can come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.64,0:17:43.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dreams do not exist for the stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.94,0:17:46.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you believe in yourself,\Nthen dreams are real.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.54,0:17:49.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And to make my dreams come true,\NI only have to do one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.02,0:17:51.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Defeat you! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.66,0:17:56.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My dream is for me to return to my true\Nidentity, the one I had before I met you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.08,0:17:58.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, true identity?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.84,0:17:59.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could it be that...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.40,0:18:01.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you the eighth Digimon?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.96,0:18:05.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This changes everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.56,0:18:07.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before I crush you,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.94,0:18:11.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll give you the pleasure of watching\Nme destroy your wizard friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.14,0:18:13.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fizzly Weed!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.08,0:18:19.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.92,0:18:24.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.52,0:18:27.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.38,0:18:30.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.02,0:18:34.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've come to help you, Gatomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.24,0:18:36.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.66,0:18:38.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quick, get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.54,0:18:39.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nova Blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.04,0:18:48.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When will you Digidestined\Never learn Crimson Lightning?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.66,0:18:56.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Greymon Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.28,0:19:10.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Greymon Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.10,0:19:24.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go get him, Metal Greymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.06,0:19:30.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, MetalGreymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.82,0:19:32.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mega Claw!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.70,0:19:38.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Giga Blaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.52,0:19:48.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You impudent fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.40,0:19:52.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you really think you could beat me\Nwith those pathetic little toys of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.82,0:19:54.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.22,0:20:00.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice try, buddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.86,0:20:03.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the Digidestined are\Ncoming to defend Gatomon...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.06,0:20:08.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what they think is no business of\Nyours, go blow smoke somewhere else!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.42,0:20:10.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you will pay for your impudence
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.34,0:20:16.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just what do you mean? I hope you like
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.46,0:20:20.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fishing Gatomon because you're\Ngoing to be the perfect bait to lure
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.10,0:20:23.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,out the 8th digi destined child now\NI don't need the crest to find that
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.90,0:20:29.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cowardly, puny human! That's not fair,\Nmy Myotismon. I don't play fair. Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.58,0:20:31.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gatomon
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.00,0:20:35.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai help me
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.52,0:20:42.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I wonder what's taking them so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.98,0:20:44.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back, Gatomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.68,0:20:49.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will Tai rescue Gatomon\Nbefore Myotismon finds Kari?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.38,0:20:53.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tune in to the next\NDigimon Digital Monsters.
